</section>

<!-- ═══ FAQ ═══ -->
<section id="faq" data-screen-label="FAQ">
  <div class="faq-inner">
    <div class="faq-header">
      <h2 class="faq-label reveal d1">Common<br /><em>Questions.</em></h2>
      <p class="faq-intro reveal d1">Everything you need to know about membership, how it works, and who it's for.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item reveal d1">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>WHAT HAPPENS AFTER I JOIN?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>It starts with a real conversation. We get on a call, understand where you're at, what you're building, what your goals are, and what's actually in your way. From there we plug you into the network and make your first introduction to a member or board operator who can directly help with what you're working on right now. You're in the community, the masterclasses, and the calls before your first week is out. You get real value before you've had time to wonder if this was worth it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d2">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>HOW WILL IT HELP GROW MY BUSINESS?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>PVC isn't a course and it's not a coaching programme. It's a network of people who are actually building, alongside operators who've already built. Your standard rises when the people around you are moving. You start thinking differently when someone two steps ahead of you is accessible. And the opportunities, the clients, the partnerships, the connections, they don't come from chasing. They come from consistently being in the right room. That's what PVC puts you in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d3">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>WHO IS THIS FOR?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Founders already generating revenue who want to scale faster. R10k/month minimum in their business. You've started, you're moving, you have a real problem you're solving and skin in the game. Not someone looking for motivation to begin. Someone who's already in it and wants to be around people doing the same thing at a higher level. Not your age, not your stage. Just the standard.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item reveal d4">
        <button type="button" class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>DO I NEED TO BE IN SOUTH AFRICA?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon">+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>No. Geography doesn't matter. Standard does. We're built in Africa, open to anyone, anywhere, who's dialled in.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ═══ CLOSE ═══ -->
<section id="close" data-screen-label="Close">
  <div class="photo-slot close-photo">
    <img src="/images/close-atmosphere.jpg" alt="Illuminated pool at night in a courtyard" />
  </div>
  <svg class="noise-layer" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" style="z-index:5" set:html={NOISE('n8')} />
  <div class="close-eyebrow eyebrow reveal">Private Victories Club</div>
